quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  41,1,Ha-Mim.
  41,2,"(This is) a revelation from the Most-Compassionate, the All-Merciful."
  41,3,"(This is) a Book whose verses are well elaborated; a Qur’an, in Arabic, for people who know,"
  41,4,"a bearer of good news and a warner. But most of them have turned away, and they do not listen (to it)."
  41,5,"They say: ‘Our hearts are in veils (preventing us) from what you invite us to, and there is a deafness in our ears and a barrier between you and us. So do (as you please), and so shall we.’"
  41,6,"Say: ‘I am only a human being like you. It has been revealed to me that your God is only One God, so be steadfast towards Him and seek forgiveness from Him.’ And woe to the polytheists,"
  41,7,those who do not give the Alms-due and are disbelievers in the Hereafter.
  41,8,"As for those who believe and perform righteous deeds, they will have an everlasting reward."
  41,9,Say: ‘Do you indeed disbelieve in the One Who created the earth in two periods and ascribe equals to Him? That is the Lord of all worlds.’
  41,10,"He placed therein firm mountains rising above its surface. And He blessed it and apportioned its (various) means of sustenance in four periods, alike for all the seekers (of provision)."
  41,11,"Then He turned towards the heavenly universe while it was (still like) smoke. Then He said to it and the earth: ‘Come (in compliance to My laws), willingly or unwillingly.’ Both said: ‘We submit (to Your laws of nature) with pleasure.’"
